# under KiroHome() — i.e. ~/.kiro/settings/mcp.json. Before this option existed,
# the package's own tests constructed a store and OVERWROTE the developer's real
# file (observed, not hypothetical). WithKASConfigPath is how every test points
# that write at t.TempDir().
#
# It is a functional option rather than a package var on purpose: a global
# override has to be remembered at each call site, while an argument is visible
# in the construction itself. The default is pinned by
# TestNew_DefaultKASPathIsUnderKiroHome, so production cannot silently drift to
# the test path either.
